{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:903db93e4afd92e2b018a01e8b169973070b3cdf86fa70fd8b1c1eb3d5510029",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81317062f43c4cfc1e4ce7c0b2e868359d54d427855b9a7cf2158783677baec5",
      "text": "嗯～久违的临时营业，真好玩～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adc498c59fa8133fa0749297f0c0b2c64b9f351c3128bcb8244c8d1fddefa9ca",
      "text": "我也觉得好开心啊。\n之前太忙了，一直抽不出时间开店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:321419196491be94d2dcf21d4910dc711cfff99d45fca99f8090d581bff18012",
      "text": "嗯。再过一段时间，我们Cafe Parade\n出演的电影就要上映了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe374e0c58c9b3146cd5d4b3589717429ea74438d20c655e8fbdafe6f522125",
      "text": "宣传和采访的工作接下来也会逐渐增加，\n日程会变得更加忙碌哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2d54b57bb2665c8745bfdbe18dbc38c50b394048d1f109d5363a1205a939c9",
      "text": "是啊。\n话说回来距离公映也没剩多少时间了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708dc2aee1dcf19e948a3631e846b00684496fcf0065061d5cf0627cc914ca76",
      "text": "总觉得前几天才刚杀青，\n时间过得可真快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d4c1783eb39115d16d86f12064494931daca9c2ccf69b9b8bdbb0e7ffd4873",
      "text": "拍摄虽然辛苦但也很有趣呢～\n真想早点在电影院看到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc709644a5476e5c7f23435ad57c648b84e8ac08dbe0b47ca674d7225c02e99",
      "text": "嗯。封印了吾等同胞团英姿的幻影……\n真希望能早日让光之民一睹为快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1df8cad092d9f652ed8ac4fceec2abf379b0a1bdc35002d1eb31e37aa4bf0ed",
      "text": "“现身吧糖果流行怪兽！将这城镇里的\n糕点师统统吞噬殆尽吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96111a5ebbc5b4cf34ad0f627539b30c90547c51eaecbf601aeb27581322a133",
      "text": "哈哈，阿斯兰真是演了个非常适合你的角色啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f41104df16cbcfa8d978d7722e8d4c1ea518735e7da33b9fc3b22694b135e2",
      "text": "嗯。而且，那部作品充满了对蛋糕的爱意。\n哪怕只是为了一个镜头，也会特地准备货真价实的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73c73dc1667b9ea588d024413c58fd694d9cfc0926b2a7201c700694e65b83cf",
      "text": "拍摄结束后分给大家的蛋糕，每一款都绝顶美味！\n特别是在高潮部分出现的那款蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03070f2ca80ccd4fc95c3d941ae0710cb6247bfb713d41907a082fb312f71bd7",
      "text": "是的。那是极其细腻且精彩的极品呢。真想下次找机会\n好好钻研一番它究竟运用了怎样的技巧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:589be23455aa297486e70a1fb3f707e61a701ae3e33000727c8c17c051e26ddd",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000219:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99b87707bac75920a0ba479f24f951690dc78eabc600c98b82bb3e08d4a6436e",
      "text": "啊，制作人。辛苦了。\n一直在等您呢。您说的重要事情，是指什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000229:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db603e4ad3d3c596fb22588b2e66cce42ae3555da1dcd2ec24e01b1ca1d41ac3",
      "text": "好的。其实是接到了新工作的邀约……\n请大家过目这份企划书！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
